      <title>一头鲸鱼一天能吃好几吨磷虾，为什么磷虾还没被吃灭绝？</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/climate/post/20260913/%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%B4%E9%B2%B8%E9%B1%BC%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%90%83%E5%A5%BD%E5%87%A0%E5%90%A8%E7%A3%B7%E8%99%BE%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E7%A3%B7%E8%99%BE%E8%BF%98%E6%B2%A1%E8%A2%AB%E5%90%83%E7%81%AD%E7%BB%9D/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
